    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221220/extras/c4b32908404df8d85ea1c9d0e1058b93.avif?t=1669067266\" /></div><br><br>FinalCypher is team-based strategic FPS that's powered by ground-breaking technology to empower players to govern and modd gameplay. The gameplay takes place in a cyberpunk-styled environments with multiple characters you can choose from. Players needs to decipher a crypto-wallet that holds a massive amount of money in order to win. First to complete 13 rounds wins. Characters have different stats and role that suits different playing styles.<br><br><br>FinalCypher: by Station Zero X (FC:0x) expands upon the team-based action gameplay.<br><br><strong>How to play FinalCypher?</strong><br>- Download the game launcher from station0x.<br>- Run the game launcher and after the account creation, activate your account using the invitation link sent to your email.<br><br><strong>How will you explore the world of FinalCypher?</strong><br><br>FinalCypher is a Futuristic strategy FPS game, set in a future world powered by groundbreaking technology that gives players the freedom to play how they want: exploring, crafting, mining or governing in a uniquely moddable, open-source adventure.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221220/extras/c4b32908404df8d85ea1c9d0e1058b93.avif?t=1669067266\" /></div><br><br>FinalCypher is team-based strategic FPS that's powered by ground-breaking technology to empower players to govern and modd gameplay. The gameplay takes place in a cyberpunk-styled environments with multiple characters you can choose from. Players needs to decipher a crypto-wallet that holds a massive amount of money in order to win. First to complete 13 rounds wins. Characters have different stats and role that suits different playing styles.<br><br><br>FinalCypher: by Station Zero X (FC:0x) expands upon the team-based action gameplay.<br><br><strong>How to play FinalCypher?</strong><br>- Download the game launcher from station0x.<br>- Run the game launcher and after the account creation, activate your account using the invitation link sent to your email.<br><br><strong>How will you explore the world of FinalCypher?</strong><br><br>FinalCypher is a Futuristic strategy FPS game, set in a future world powered by groundbreaking technology that gives players the freedom to play how they want: exploring, crafting, mining or governing in a uniquely moddable, open-source adventure.",
